# Files Descriptions:

anot_mosaic.py - script which runs over the dataset and generates the annotated mosaics by their ground-truth.
cost_sensitive_loss.py - the class of the loss used while training the model.
data.py - the data collector, dataset, and defenitions used regarding the data.
model.py - class to wrap the model.
nosaic_annotator.py - the mosaic annotations viewer for the medical team.
scheduler.py - the scheduler class used in the project.
utils.py - general utilization functions.
train.py - the main code for training the model.
inference.ipynb - the inference notebook.